ox II ×30\nIntermediate Reward: Lumamber ×200 + Sublime ×1,000\nIntermediate Reward: Lumamber ×200 + Nightium ×200,000\n\n\n<b><color=#696868>Probabilities:</color></b>\nThe table below shows the base probabilities of obtaining the 10 rewards.\nWhen a reward is obtained, the probabilities for the remaining items in the pool are recalculated accordingly using these starting numbers (keeping the sum of probabilities at 100%). <b><color=#696868>The base probabilities are the same for all Navigators participating in the event. </color></b><b><color=#d59519>Tap the dynamic probability table button on the main page for more details.</color></b>",
