  str_senior_skin_draw_rule_reward_detail_gl_review = "Navigators have a chance of getting the Special Outfit <color=#e89416>Day at the Aquarium</color> from the <color=#d24956>6th</color> wish onward. The outfit and all the other reward items can be acquired within <color=#d24956>10</color> wishes.\n\nThe complete list of rewards is as follows:\nTop Reward: Gronru's Special Outfit <color=#e89416>Day at the Aquarium</color> ×1 (receive Lumamber ×3,000 instead when getting a duplicate).\nRare Reward: Lumamber ×<color=#d24956>600</color> + Limited-Edition Cloud Gardens Furnishing: <color=#e89416>Decorative Coral</color> ×1 (receive Lumamber ×600 + Special Star Flare ×1 instead when getting a duplicate). \nRare Reward: Lumamber ×<color=#d24956>600</color> + Limited-Edition Avatar Frame: <color=#e89416>Seashore Umbrella</color> ×1 (receive Lumamber ×600 + Special Star Flare ×1 instead when getting a duplicate).\nRare Reward: Lumamber ×<color=#d24956>600</color> + Limited-Edition Avatar: <color=#e89416>Gaming Gronru</color> ×1 (receive Lumamber ×600 + Special Star Flare ×1 instead when getting a duplicate). \nAdvanced Reward: Lumamber ×<color=#d24956>300</color> + <color=#e89416>Yellow Order Box IV</color> ×10\nAdvanced Reward: Lumamber ×<color=#d24956>300</color> + <color=#e89416>Jasper Order Box III</color> ×25\nAdvanced Reward: Lumamber ×<color=#d24956>300</color> + <color=#e89416>Recharger Pack</color> ×10 \nIntermediate Reward: Lumamber ×<color=#d24956>200</color> + <color=#e89416>Jasper Order Box II</color> ×30\nIntermediate Reward: Lumamber ×<color=#d24956>200</color> + <color=#e89416>Sublime</color> ×1,000\nIntermediate Reward: Lumamber ×<color=#d24956>200</color> + <color=#e89416>Nightium</color> ×200,000.",
  str_senior_skin_draw_gift_count_gl = "Ticket ×{1}",
  str_senior_skin_draw_rule_title_qt = "Mesmerizing Eventide Rules",
  str_senior_skin_draw_rule_detail_qt = "○<color=#d24956>1</color> reward is guaranteed for each wish made. Navigators can make their 1st wish for free and use Heavyweight Glasses to make <color=#d24956>9</color> more wishes.\n○The event offers <color=#d24956>10</color> rewards in total, each of which can be obtained <color=#d24956>once</color> with no repeat. Once a reward is obtained from a wish, it is removed from the reward pool and will no longer be obtainable. Make <color=#d24956>10</color> wishes to claim all the rewards.\n○The number of Heavyweight Glasses required to make each wish varies. The <color=#d24956>2nd</color> to <color=#d24956>10th</color> wish respectively costs <color=#d24956>1</color>, <color=#d24956>1</color>, <color=#d24956>2</color>, <color=#d24956>4</color>, <color=#d24956>6</color>, <color=#d24956>6</color>, <color=#d24956>10</color>, <color=#d24956>10</color>, and <color=#d24956>10</color> Heavyweight Glasses. The required quantity is shown on the Make a Wish button.\n○Heavyweight Glasses may be purchased. As a limited-time item, any unused Heavyweight Glasses by the end of the <color=#e89416>Mesmerizing Eventide</color> event will be automatically converted into <color=#d24956>100</color> Lumamber. Please check your mail for it <color=#d24956>1</color> hour after the event ends.",
  str_senior_skin_draw_rule_reward_detail_qt = "Navigators have a chance of getting the Special Outfit <color=#e89416>Tipsy Whimsy</color> from the <color=#d24956>6th</color> wish onward. The outfit and all other rewards can be acquired within <color=#d24956>10</color> wishes.\n\nThe complete list of rewards is as follows:\nTop Reward: Azure's Special Outfit <color=#e89416>Tipsy Whimsy</color> ×1. Duplicates will be converted to Lumamber ×3,000.\nRare Reward: Lumamber ×<color=#d24956>600</color> + Limited-Edition Cloud Gardens Furnishing: <color=#e89416>Director's Sofa</color> ×1. Duplicates will be converted to Lumamber ×600 + Special Star Flare ×1.\nRare Reward: Lumamber ×<color=#d24956>600</color> + Limited-Edition Avatar Frame: <color=#e89416>Actual Glasses</color> ×1. Duplicates will be converted to Lumamber ×600 + Special Star Flare ×1.\nRare Reward: Lumamber ×<color=#d24956>600</color> + Limited-Edition Avatar: <color=#e89416>Azure's Prey</color> ×1. Duplicates will be converted to Lumamber ×600 + Special Star Flare ×1.\nAdvanced Reward: Lumamber ×<color=#d24956>300</color> + <color=#e89416>Blue Order Box IV</color> ×10\nAdvanced Reward: Lumamber ×<color=#d24956>300</color> + <color=#e89416>Jasper Order Box III</color> ×25\nAdvanced Reward: Lumamber ×<color=#d24956>300</color> + <color=#e89416>Recharger Pack</color> ×10\nIntermediate Reward: Lumamber ×<color=#d24956>200</color> + <color=#e89416>Jasper Order Box II</color> ×30\nIntermediate Reward: Lumamber ×<color=#d24956>200</color> + <color=#e89416>Sublime</color> ×1,000\nIntermediate Reward: Lumamber ×<color=#d24956>200</color> + <color=#e89416>Nightium</color> ×200,000",
  str_senior_skin_draw_rule_reward_tips_title_qt = "Probabilities",
  str_senior_skin_draw_rule_reward_tips_qt = [[
The table below shows the base probabilities of obtaining the <color=#d24956>10</color> rewards.
When a reward is obtained, the probabilities for the remaining items in the pool are recalculated accordingly using these starting numbers (keeping the sum of probabilities at <color=#d24956>100%</color>). <b>The base probabilities are the same for all Navigators participating in the event. </b><b>Tap the dynamic probability table button on the main page for more details.</b>]],
  str_senior_skin_draw_dp_title_qt = "Mesmerizing Eventide Dynamic Probability Info",
  str_senior_skin_draw_rule_probability_detail_qt = "All participating Navigators are subject to the same base probability as detailed in the rules. Since each reward can be obtained once only, the drawing probabilities for the remaining items will be recalculated dynamically to reflect the previous drawing result. <b>The principle of our dynamic probability change is: Once obtained rewards are removed, the system recalculates the drawing probability for the remaining rewards in an equal ratio according to the number of wishes already made and the base probability, keeping the sum of probabilities at 1.</b>",
