  str_senior_skin_draw_rule_probability_down_qt = "Navigators may see different dynamic probabilities. If Player A and Player B draw the same reward for their 1st wish, the dynamic probability for their remaining rewards will be the same for their 2nd wish. However, if Player A and Player C receive different rewards for their 1st wish, they will have different items remaining in their pools for the 2nd wish, and thus, their rewards' dynamic probability will be different. If there are any questions, please contact our customer service at any time.",
